{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"d51606413f67477ea54625f93409046c1eda8bb31b4dc86c6d54013842a8a5ae","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01W7fRRNK921q3ANXh2LhfgJ","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/README.md","old_string":"    (rain: near streaks a drop wide but never under a pixel and a half,\n    faint out in the dark and glittering by a lamp, a fire, a flare or the\n    lightning,\n    and beyond them, out to ~60 m, sheets of rain worked out per pixel on\n    four cylinders round the eye in one full-screen draw, hidden behind the\n    scene by its depth (on low quality, which has no depth to read, the same\n    four cylinders drawn as meshes with the scene, hidden by its depth test),\n    lit by the lamps near them and by a burning flare;","new_string":"    (rain: near streaks a drop wide but never under a pixel and a half,\n    faint out in the dark and glittering by a lamp, a fire, a flare or the\n    lightning,\n    and beyond them, out to ~60 m, sheets of rain worked out per pixel on\n    four cylinders round the eye in one full-screen draw, hidden behind the\n    scene by its depth (on low quality, which has no depth to read, the same\n    four cylinders drawn as meshes with the scene, hidden by its depth test),\n    lit by the lamps near them and by a burning flare; the streaks near and\n    far seen by the light they catch, as rain at night is - hardly at all\n    out in the dark, where a drop shows only the dark beyond it, most with\n    a lamp or a fire beyond them, a drop sending on most of the light it\n    catches as a lens does (a Henyey-Greenstein lobe);"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
