{"parentUuid":"24cec163-c9f7-468a-8a70-425d72c6f2bf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGXF8DcW3NTvvoooUShn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UF3cegmAeFPmeAJWhYz26g","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, eighth:\n- QA sweep of 12 route views (qa01-12): no rendering faults; GPU on high 15-37 ms (qa09 track 36.8,\n  qa07 street north 34.6, qa08 bridge 29.8, qa03 village entry 29.4). The one look problem in every\n  frame: even, static-like rain streaks over the dark sky.\n- Reference: arXiv 2510.17440 (nighttime deraining, RealRain-1k / HQ-NightRain photographs): night\n  rain \"only visible near light sources\", also lost in over-bright areas; uniformly added synthetic\n  rain is what looks fake. Its fig. 8 (a street lamp in rain) = the target. Viewed headless, deleted.\n- Found by isolating (frozen G.time, uArty and rain uFlash held 0): the far sheets (cylinders 14-57 m,\n  uColor * 0.3 regardless of light), not the near drops, drew the static. NB a material found by\n  \"has uFog\" is not the sheets (the sky/beams have one) - match uVel === rain's uVel.\n- df7b876d night rain shows by the light it catches: sheets' alpha x (uUnlit 0.5 + flash + lum*4),\n  drops' boost 1.5 -> 4, both lit through Henyey-Greenstein g 0.45 (forward lobe: rain seen against\n  a lamp brightest). Dark sky now a faint veil.\n- 24e8f646 rain glitters in the lamplight (weather.js glints + lights.js `flash: true` on flash\n  entries): 4 lamp/fire slots (cone != null or fog < 1, within 30 m, fade from 22) + 2 flash slots,\n  1080 drops each on high (count * 0.12), box R = clamp(range/4, 2.2, 4.5) hung 0.45R below capped\n  lamps, world-fixed drops (mod against the box centre), shelter 6x6 landY per light (cached by\n  place), colour = lit*60 capped at 16 (a drop images the light: dimmer and it vanishes in the\n  volumetric haze - that was the first two tries), own muzzle at the eye kept at 15%.\n  Cost: within noise (<= ~0.5 ms by the fire). Low quality draws it with the scene, checked.\n  Checks: low/medium/high compile (93/141/141, 0 bad), 9 node checks, merge-tree clean.\n  Not seen in a real browser window: headless renders only, frozen frames (motion not judged).\nEOF\nrm -f REDACTED*.png; ls REDACTED | grep -c zref","description":"Add this turn to the shared notes and delete the references"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2248,"cache_read_input_tokens":373689,"output_tokens":1194,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2248,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1194,"cache_read_input_tokens":373689,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2248,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2248},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01UF3cegmAeFPmeAJWhYz26g":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, eighth:\n- QA sweep of 12 route views (qa01-12): no rendering faults; GPU on high 15-37 ms (qa09 track 36.8,\n  qa07 street north 34.6, qa08 bridge 29.8, qa03 village entry 29.4). The one look problem in every\n  frame: even, static-like rain streaks over the dark sky.\n- Reference: arXiv 2510.17440 (nighttime deraining, RealRain-1k / HQ-NightRain photographs): night\n  rain \"only visible near light sources\", also lost in over-bright areas; uniformly added synthetic\n  rain is what looks fake. Its fig. 8 (a street lamp in rain) = the target. Viewed headless, deleted.\n- Found by isolating (frozen G.time, uArty and rain uFlash held 0): the far sheets (cylinders 14-57 m,\n  uColor * 0.3 regardless of light), not the near drops, drew the static. NB a material found by\n  \"has uFog\" is not the sheets (the sky/beams have one) - match uVel === rain's uVel.\n- df7b876d night rain shows by the light it catches: sheets' alpha x (uUnlit 0.5 + flash + lum*4),\n  drops' boost 1.5 -> 4, both lit through Henyey-Greenstein g 0.45 (forward lobe: rain seen against\n  a lamp brightest). Dark sky now a faint veil.\n- 24e8f646 rain glitters in the lamplight (weather.js glints + lights.js `flash: true` on flash\n  entries): 4 lamp/fire slots (cone != null or fog < 1, within 30 m, fade from 22) + 2 flash slots,\n  1080 drops each on high (count * 0.12), box R = clamp(range/4, 2.2, 4.5) hung 0.45R below capped\n  lamps, world-fixed drops (mod against the box centre), shelter 6x6 landY per light (cached by\n  place), colour = lit*60 capped at 16 (a drop images the light: dimmer and it vanishes in the\n  volumetric haze - that was the first two tries), own muzzle at the eye kept at 15%.\n  Cost: within noise (<= ~0.5 ms by the fire). Low quality draws it with the scene, checked.\n  Checks: low/medium/high compile (93/141/141, 0 bad), 9 node checks, merge-tree clean.\n  Not seen in a real browser window: headless renders only, frozen frames (motion not judged).\nEOF\nrm -f REDACTED*.png; ls REDACTED | grep -c zref","description":"Add this turn to the shared notes and delete the references"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"5d283e87-6c3d-45f3-8e4a-5037f78df34b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGXF7jqwK3u3zbuTNPUn","requestRef":"3b15dcc8-0ab8-46d9-8175-c880136019af","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"update_plan","type":"assistant","uuid":"eb6564e7-4650-484b-a8a1-b2963d4a2708","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:55:37.206Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","