{"parentUuid":"2b5e5bfa-21a1-4e39-879b-3cd4e6912a1a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"17b7ed16-a101-4402-afdd-06026f97016b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013FJQJguHQkYRY17uAE2Kcb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Call of Duty Vanguard \"Operation Tonga\" full mission walkthrough youtube\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Call Of Duty: Vanguard: Operation Tonga Walkthrough -- Where To Hide\",\"url\":\"https://gamespot.REDACTED\"},{\"title\":\"campaign mission list\",\"url\":\"https://www.gfinityesports.com/call-of-duty-vanguard/campaign-mission-list/\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty Vanguard on PS5 and Xbox One X – The DVDfever Review\",\"url\":\"https://dvd-fever.co.uk/call-of-duty-vanguard-on-ps5-and-xbox-one-x-the-dvdfever-review/\"},{\"title\":\"how to reach the windmill in cod vanguard\",\"url\":\"https://diamondlobby.com/call-of-duty/vanguard/how-to-reach-the-windmill-in-cod-vanguard/\"},{\"title\":\"www.gameswelt.de\",\"url\":\"https://www.gameswelt.de/call-of-duty-vanguard/komplettloesung/komplettloesung-guide-fuer-die-kampagne-alle-trophaeen-achievements-311172/2\"},{\"title\":\"cod call of duty vanguard actions speak louder than words trophy achievement guide\",\"url\":\"https://selphie1999gaming.com/game-guides/cod-call-of-duty-vanguard-actions-speak-louder-than-words-trophy-achievement-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"92656 call of duty vanguard le battaglie che lo hanno ispirato\",\"url\":\"https://www.animeclick.it/news/92656-call-of-duty-vanguard-le-battaglie-che-lo-hanno-ispirato\"},{\"title\":\"cod call of duty vanguard only you can prevent friendly casualties trophy achievement guide\",\"url\":\"https://selphie1999gaming.com/game-guides/cod-call-of-duty-vanguard-only-you-can-prevent-friendly-casualties-trophy-achievement-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty Vanguard\",\"url\":\"https://www.breakflip.com/?p=75865\"}]\n\nI didn't find a full-mission YouTube video in these results. They're written guides, which may still help.\n\n- **Opening section:** A GameSpot walkthrough covers the start of the mission, where Kingsley loses his equipment, save for a knife, and it explains a hiding route near the windmill.\n- **Getting a weapon:** Diamond Lobby's guide describes taking a right next to the fallen tree, where a German soldier shines a flashlight toward you, and suggests crouching behind a tree stump.\n- **Trophies:** Selphie1999Gaming has guides for two trophies in this mission, Actions Speak Louder Than Words and Only You Can Prevent Friendly Casualties.\n- **Other formats:** GameSpot's guide is text-based, and a German guide (Gameswelt) also covers this mission. Both are in the results, though I didn't check their depth.\n\nTo find a full video, search YouTube directly for \"Call of Duty Vanguard Operation Tonga full mission\" and filter by recent uploads. The results don't include a specific video link or title.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"5455569a-7c88-43c7-afca-cc710f929f1c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:57:15.144Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Call of Duty Vanguard \"Operation Tonga\" full mission walkthrough youtube","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01VXBDEuJQ3FXEQ4xVgt2ZfR","content":[{"title":"Call Of Duty: Vanguard: Operation Tonga Walkthrough -- Where To Hide","url":"https://gamespot.REDACTED"},{"title":"campaign mission list","url":"https://www.gfinityesports.com/call-of-duty-vanguard/campaign-mission-list/"},{"title":"Call of Duty Vanguard on PS5 and Xbox One X – The DVDfever Review","url":"https://dvd-fever.co.uk/call-of-duty-vanguard-on-ps5-and-xbox-one-x-the-dvdfever-review/"},{"title":"how to reach the windmill in cod vanguard","url":"https://diamondlobby.com/call-of-duty/vanguard/how-to-reach-the-windmill-in-cod-vanguard/"},{"title":"www.gameswelt.de","url":"https://www.gameswelt.de/call-of-duty-vanguard/komplettloesung/komplettloesung-guide-fuer-die-kampagne-al