{"parentUuid":"487d3223-6fb3-4c54-8bd1-8da127e986eb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"17b7ed16-a101-4402-afdd-06026f97016b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012kJQgrvWHpty1QyN86GuYF","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Call of Duty Vanguard Operation Tonga mission gameplay\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"OPERATION TONGA\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_y_xqvGnEwU\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty Vanguard (PS5) Operation Tonga\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oOKdaxg8kxg\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty Vanguard Campaign Mission 2: Operation Tonga\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fWRNGtJS3Lo\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty: Vanguard Campaign Walkthrough - Operation Tonga - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b7jQtuJDbh4\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty: Vanguard - Campaign Mission #2 - Operation Tonga (D-Day Airplane Drop) - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A5HXxWt-71g\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty: Vanguard - \\\"Operation Tonga\\\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BI8nDn4aLJs\"},{\"title\":\"VANGUARD: OPERATION TONGA - 100% Guide Veteran Difficulty With All Trophies No Spoilers - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tmNDPDHQvFY\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty: Vanguard - Operation Tonga - WORLD WAR (WW2)\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dv2IGsPuGTQ\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty: Vanguard - Operation Tonga Mission Walkthrough\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C_b12boXwUQ\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty Vanguard: Operation Tonga - Epic D-Day Jump [PT-BR] PS5 4K 60FPS - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hmSfDcg_gKo\"}]\n\nThe search returned only YouTube videos, so there's no written guide or official source on the mission's mechanics. The descriptions do point to a few consistent themes.\n\n- **Setting and structure:** Operation Tonga is the second campaign mission. One video calls it the D-Day airplane drop, and another describes a regroup with the squad near the start.\n- **Gameplay style:** One description highlights airborne combat and tactical movement, with a stealth-friendly approach and a Veteran difficulty run also covered.\n- **Guides and walkthroughs:** Several uploads offer no-commentary full walkthroughs in 4K, one covering a 100% Veteran run with all trophies, and another with a tutorial-style walkthrough.\n\nFor specifics like objectives or tactics, the walkthrough videos are the best place to look. They're listed in the search results, and the upload dates vary from under a year to several years old.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"c46962c9-d4f8-40c2-8e17-04aeedb19e70","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:57:29.235Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Call of Duty Vanguard Operation Tonga mission gameplay","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01NYZSQinSvbvmWyEgpMPzRf","content":[{"title":"OPERATION TONGA","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_y_xqvGnEwU"},{"title":"Call of Duty Vanguard (PS5) Operation Tonga","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oOKdaxg8kxg"},{"title":"Call of Duty Vanguard Campaign Mission 2: Operation Tonga","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fWRNGtJS3Lo"},{"title":"Call of Duty: Vanguard Campaign Walkthrough - Operation Tonga - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b7jQtuJDbh4"},{"title":"Call of Duty: Vanguard - Campaign Mission #2 - Operation Tonga (D-Day Airplane Drop) - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A5HXxWt-71g"},{"title":"Call of Duty: Vanguard - \"Operation Tonga\"","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BI8nDn4aLJs"},{"title":"VANGUARD: OPERATION TONGA - 100% Guide Veteran Difficulty With All Trophies No Spoilers - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tmNDPDHQvFY"},{"title":"Call of Duty: Vanguard - Operation Tonga - WORLD WAR (WW2)","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dv2IGsPuGTQ"},{"title":"Call of Duty: Vanguard - Operation Tonga Mission Walkthrough","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C_b12boXwUQ"},{"title":"Call of Duty Vanguard: Operation Tonga - Epic D-Day Jump [PT-BR] PS5 4K 60FPS - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hmSfDcg_gKo"}]},"The search returned only YouTube videos, so there's no written guide or official source on the mission's mechanics. The descriptions do point to a few consistent themes.\n\n- **Setting and structure:** Operation Tonga is the second campaign mission. One video calls it the D-Day airplane drop, and another describes a regroup with the squad near the start.\n- **Gameplay style:** One description highlights airborne combat and tactical movement, with a stealth-friendly approach and a Veteran difficulty run also covered.\n- **Guides and walkthroughs:** Several uploads offer no-commentary full walkthroughs in 4K, one covering a 100% Veteran run with all trophies, and another with a tutorial-style walkthrough.\n\nFor specifics like objectives or tactics, the walkthrough videos are the best place to look. They're listed in the search results, and the upload dates vary from under a year to several years old."],"durationSeconds":4.685938250005245,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"b895621f-62bc-4f4f-9126-f33d7391c610","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","branch":"hedgerow-grass","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public