{"parentUuid":"d4dd76fc-afdf-4a43-8765-c81bb5a809a3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"17b7ed16-a101-4402-afdd-06026f97016b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JugKfJwn5bqaY6aft8EZ8e","type":"tool_result","content":"/* Hedgerow — fire as flame: procedural flames at each fire near the camera.\n\n   Over every fire within 60 m (the burning truck, the house, the flak gun\n   once it is blown) stand five billboards over its whole breadth, rising\n   out of the wreck two to three metres, each turned to the camera about\n   its upright axis, and each a body of flame worked out in its shader:\n   turbulent noise rising through a shape that is wide at the base and licks\n   up to points, eaten away from the top, coloured by its heat like a black\n   body — deep red at its ragged edges, through orange, to a yellow-white\n   core — bright enough to bloom. Drawn with the late particles (after the\n   anti-aliasing, so the flicker stays crisp: effects.js), hidden behind\n   what stands in front and soft where it meets the truck's cab or the wall;\n   without the effects chain it is drawn with the scene. The sprite flames\n   of effects.js thin out to the odd lick over it; the smoke and the embers\n   stay. */\n\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\n\nconst PER = 5, MAXF = 10, RANGE = 60;\n\nconst VERT = /* glsl */ `\nattribute vec4 aFire;          // xyz: the base, w: size\nattribute vec2 aSeed;          // seed, share (0..1: how big this one is)\nvarying vec2 vUv;\nvarying float vSeed, vDist;\nvarying vec2 vProj;\nvoid main() {\n  float s = aFire.w;\n  // turned to the camera about the upright axis\n  vec3 t = cameraPosition - aFire.xyz;\n  t.y = 0.0;\n  if (dot(t, t) < 1e-4) t = vec3(0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n  vec3 right = normalize(vec3(t.z, 0.0, -t.x));\n  float w = (0.95 + 0.45 * aSeed.y) * s, h = (1.8 + 1.1 * aSeed.y) * s;\n  vec3 p = aFire.xyz + right * position.x * w + vec3(0.0, position.y * h, 0.0);\n  vUv = vec2(position.x * 2.0, position.y);\n  vSeed = aSeed.x;\n  vec4 mv = viewMatrix * vec4(p, 1.0);\n  vDist = -mv.z;\n  vProj = vec2(projectionMatrix[2][2], projectionMatrix[3][2]);\n  gl_Position = projectionMatrix * mv;\n}`;\n\nconst FRAG = /* glsl */ `\nuniform float uTime, uGain, uSoft;\nuniform sampler2D tDepth;\nuniform vec2 uScreen;\nvarying vec2 vUv;\nvarying float vSeed, vDist;\nvarying vec2 vProj;\nfloat hash(vec2 p) { vec3 p3 = fract(vec3(p.xyx) * 0.1031); p3 += dot(p3, p3.yzx + 33.33); return fract((p3.x + p3.y) * p3.z); }\nfloat noise(vec2 p) {\n  vec2 i = floor(p), f = fract(p);\n  f = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n  return mix(mix(hash(i), hash(i + vec2(1.0, 0.0)), f.x), mix(hash(i + vec2(0.0, 1.0)), hash(i + vec2(1.0, 1.0)), f.x), f.y);\n}\nfloat fbm(vec2 p) { float s = 0.0, a = 0.5; for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) { s += a * noise(p); p = p * 2.03 + 17.1; a *= 0.5; } return s; }\nvoid main() {\n  float t = uTime + vSeed * 7.3;\n  vec2 uv = vUv;                 // x: -1..1 across, y: 0..1 up\n763:  function addFire(x, y, z, size = 1) {\n325:RIGHT('house_d', 99, 2.2); RIGHT('house_c', 109.5, 3.1); RIGHT('ruin_b', 121.5, 3.5, { fire: true }); RIGHT('house_b', 133, 3.8);\n340:P('truck_burnt', -1.2, 117, 168, { fire: true, debris: 4 });\n439:P('halftrack_wreck', 8.2, 253.5, 160, { fire: true, debris: 3 });\n697:  { x: 0.5, z: -2, r: 6, text: 'WASD to move, mouse to look', sub: 'Hold the right button to aim, left to fire' },","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4974d759-efc8-4215-9efb-251a2f7359c9","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:59:47.537Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"/* Hedgerow — fire as flame: procedural flames at each fire near the camera.\n\n   Over every fire within 60 m (the burning truck, the house, the flak gun\n   once it is blown) stand five billboards over its whole breadth, rising\n   out of the wreck two to three metres, each turned to the camera about\n   its upright axis, and each a body of flame worked out in its shader:\n   turbulent noise rising through a shape that is wide at the base and licks\n   up to points, eaten away from the top, coloured by its heat like a black\n   body — deep red at its ragged edges, through orange, to a yellow-white\n   core — bright enough to bloom. Drawn with the late particles (after the\n   anti-aliasing, so the flicker stays crisp: effects.js), hidden behind\n   what stands in front and soft where it meets the truck's cab or the wall;\n   without the effects chain it is drawn with the scene. The sprite flames\n   of effects.js thin out to the odd lick over it; the smoke and the embers\n   stay. */\n\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\n\nconst PER = 5, MAXF = 10, RANGE = 60;\n\nconst VERT = /* glsl */ `\nattribute vec4 aFire;          // xyz: the base, w: size\nattribute vec2 aSeed;          // seed, share (0..1: how big this one is)\nvarying vec2 vUv;\nvarying float vSeed, vDist;\nvarying vec2 vProj;\nvoid main() {\n  float s = aFire.w;\n  // turned to the camera about the upright axis\n  vec3 t = cameraPosition - aFire.xyz;\n  t.y = 0.0;\n  if (dot(t, t) < 1e-4) t = vec3(0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n  vec3 right = normalize(vec3(t.z, 0.0, -t.x));\n  float w = (0.95 + 0.45 * aSeed.y) * s, h = (1.8 + 1.1 * aSeed.y) * s;\n  vec3 p = aFire.xyz + right * position.x * w + vec3(0.0, position.y * h, 0.0);\n  vUv = vec2(position.x * 2.0, position.y);\n  vSeed = aSeed.x;\n  vec4 mv = viewMatrix * vec4(p, 1.0);\n  vDist = -mv.z;\n  vProj = vec2(projectionMatrix[2][2], projectionMatrix[3][2]);\n  gl_Position = projectionMatrix * mv;\n}`;\n\nconst FRAG = /* glsl */ `\nuniform float uTime, uGain, uSoft;\nuniform sampler2D tDepth;\nuniform vec2 uScreen;\nvarying vec2 vUv;\nvarying float vSeed, vDist;\nvarying vec2 vProj;\nfloat hash(vec2 p) { vec3 p3 = fract(vec3(p.xyx) * 0.1031); p3 += dot(p3, p3.yzx + 33.33); return fract((p3.x + p3.y) * p3.z); }\nfloat noise(vec2 p) {\n  vec2 i = floor(p), f = fract(p);\n  f = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n  return mix(mix(hash(i), hash(i + vec2(1.0, 0.0)), f.x), mix(hash(i + vec2(0.0, 1.0)), hash(i + vec2(1.0, 1.0)), f.x), f.y);\n}\nfloat fbm(vec2 p) { float s = 0.0, a = 0.5; for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) { s += a * noise(p); p = p * 2.03 + 17.1; a *= 0.5; } return s; }\nvoid main() {\n  float t = uTime + vSeed * 7.3;\n  vec2 uv = vUv;                 // x: -1..1 across, y: 0..1 up\n763:  function addFire(x, y, z, size = 1) {\n325:RIGHT('house_d', 99, 2.2); RIGHT('house_c', 109.5, 3.1); RIGHT('ruin_b', 121.5, 3.5, { fire: true }); RIGHT('house_b', 133, 3.8);\n340:P('truck_burnt', -1.2, 117, 168, { fire: true, debris: 4 });\n439:P('halftrack_wreck', 8.2, 253.5, 160, { fire: true, debris: 3 });\n697:  { x: 0.5, z: -2, r: 6, text: 'WASD to move, mouse to look', sub: 'Hold the right button to aim, left to fire' },","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"400296b9-7c8a-49af-bfdd-4929fe0f5393","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"REDACTED","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":null,"remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}]},"error":"not_a_repo"},"live_cwd":"REDACTED","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d4dd76fc-afdf-4a43-8765-c81bb5a809a3","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/js","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
