{"parentUuid":"01fd422e-4cdb-45c7-98fe-9eb7de33bfb9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGYTjqwkMRkorKwbQzDa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FGcEnBEngyMB58SYffu8kP","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, ninth:\n- Motion check (answering \"nobody saw it moving\"): motion.js steps G.time by exactly 1/60 s per\n  captured frame (G.time and sky uArty pinned with defineProperty), crops, ffmpeg -> mp4 (sent to\n  the user: mv_post2, mv_fire1, mv_ruin in scratch/snaps). Lamplight rain in motion: a dense cone\n  of streaks under the lamp leaning with the gust, no popping at the box faces; round the truck\n  fire a heavy lit downpour. Far denser-looking in motion than in frozen frames.\n- CoD reference that works without consent walls: YouTube auto-frames\n  img.youtube.com/vi/<id>/hq1|hq2|hq3.jpg of Vanguard \"Operation Tonga\" walkthroughs\n  (fWRNGtJS3Lo, C_b12boXwUQ, hmSfDcg_gKo). Normandy at night lit by whole wooden buildings ablaze,\n  embers, fire-rimmed characters. Viewed headless, deleted.\n- f5528542 the ruin at the village entry burns through and through: levels' prop option\n  `blaze: [[x, y, z, size] in the model's frame]` (+ `fireSize`) -> levelBuild adds them with\n  effects.addDebris (the debris list: flames.js, embers, sparks; NOT plumes/sky glow/heat haze/\n  smoulder bounce, which read effects.fires in list order - the sky takes the first few fires, so\n  extra entries in `fires` would push the far fires' glow out), f.smoke = false, f.gain = 0.45\n  (flames.js aSeed is now vec3: seed, share, gain); one extra light by the first blaze (door).\n  ruin_b local frame: x along the street, z towards it (door at z 4.5); interior floor open, charred\n  joists over the back-left at ~4 m. flames.js MAXF 10 -> 16 and the soft-depth test moved before\n  the fbm noise (discard if hidden): every fire cheaper (~1-2 ms at the ruin), blaze +0.5 ms.\n  Checks: low/medium/high compile (93/141/141, 0 bad), 9 node checks, merge-tree clean.\n  Not seen in a real browser window: headless renders and clips only.\nEOF\nrm -f REDACTED*; ls REDACTED | grep -c zref","description":"Note this turn and delete the reference frames"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":789,"cache_read_input_tokens":486608,"output_tokens":1492,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":46},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":789,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1492,"cache_read_input_tokens":486608,"cache_creation_input_tokens":789,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":789},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01FGcEnBEngyMB58SYffu8kP":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, ninth:\n- Motion check (answering \"nobody saw it moving\"): motion.js steps G.time by exactly 1/60 s per\n  captured frame (G.time and sky uArty pinned with defineProperty), crops, ffmpeg -> mp4 (sent to\n  the user: mv_post2, mv_fire1, mv_ruin in scratch/snaps). Lamplight rain in motion: a dense cone\n  of streaks under the lamp leaning with the gust, no popping at the box faces; round the truck\n  fire a heavy lit downpour. Far denser-looking in motion than in frozen frames.\n- CoD reference that works without consent walls: YouTube auto-frames\n  img.youtube.com/vi/<id>/hq1|hq2|hq3.jpg of Vanguard \"Operation Tonga\" walkthroughs\n  (fWRNGtJS3Lo, C_b12boXwUQ, hmSfDcg_gKo). Normandy at night l