{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","id":"7ef09bea-94dc-490a-b492-35e260636074","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:12:01.132Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"b880ec811c15b646f9012e782c42974027e0eddc512cfae1370cf4df924f4f49","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"4ced17d0-9f92-4df2-9788-7b7a082fe4fb","keep":535,"tail":["4d801841a84e2571ccc9476348d0d69d2938564deff42b6b3fd965a6403eb8e5","627f3fe88d847a47a18b4b28f1afd6bca9307e110e28bc825f067ac775c8f576","0f2e1d2b1d9e91beb6a217091012d8a5bc20706e7f6466cdb2c1207352513f32"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",537,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"99845babb7929875ea911cc3c8c39d2e6529ad313c4b83d929c3676230ca93ee"}
{"parentUuid":"575699ec-efea-49c9-8c5e-1f6c30f36085","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGYWeZXoj68FkMPcUzoT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Committed f5528542 on `hedgerow-grass` (not pushed): the ruin at the village entry now visibly burns, with flames in its door, windows and upper window, and firelight across the wet cobbles. I also watched the lamplight rain from 24e8f646 in motion; it holds up. Both were checked only in headless renders and clips, never in a real browser window.\n\n- **The rain in motion:** I stepped the game clock 1/60 s per frame and made 60 fps clips: `mv_post2.mp4` (street lamp), `mv_fire1.mp4` (truck fire) and `mv_ruin.mp4` (the ruin), sent above. Under a lamp it's a dense cone of streaks leaning with the wind, with no popping. Around the burning truck it's a heavy, bright lit downpour, much stronger in motion than in still frames.\n- **The reference:** frames from Call of Duty: Vanguard's night Normandy mission (\"Operation Tonga\") are dominated by whole buildings on fire. Our ruin had one small fire deep inside its walls, so from the street it read as a dark shell.\n- **What changed:** extra flames sit across the ruin's floor and up in the burnt joists of the floor above. Each is dimmer than a normal fire, so the openings show flame tongues rather than white boxes. They add no smoke of their own, so the smoke column, the glow on the clouds and the far fires stay as they were. The ruin's own fire is bigger, and a new light by its door spills firelight into the street.\n- **Cost:** the flame shader now skips pixels hidden behind walls before doing its expensive work. That made every fire cheaper (about 1–2 ms near the ruin), and the new flames cost about 0.5 ms when you stand in front of it.\n- **Checks:** all three quality presets compile with no errors, the nine node tests pass, and the branch still merges cleanly with hedgerow-poc.\n\nThe test server and headless Chrome are stopped, the reference frames are deleted, and the shared notes have this turn's details.\n\nSources: [Vanguard Operation Tonga (fWRNGtJS3Lo)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fWRNGtJS3Lo), [Operation Tonga walkthrough (C_b12boXwUQ)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C_b12boXwUQ), [Operation Tonga 4K (hmSfDcg_gKo)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hmSfDcg_gKo)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":483,"cache_read_input_tokens":490484,"output_tokens":840,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":483,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":840,"cache_read_input_tokens":490484,"cache_creation_input_tokens":483,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":483},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"fa46acea-6503-4780-ba6e-c01bb8effb21","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGYWe5kseah82bHYtFGv","requestRef":"7ef09bea-94dc-490a-b492-35e260636074","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"ae315503-27c5-4396-9b6e-36f859197d7b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:12:09.558Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
