{"parentUuid":"d63184d9-040b-4771-8bd7-9c2031b646bb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"17b7ed16-a101-4402-afdd-06026f97016b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DRCMT8Q8nzUiuBJb5jNTsb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Medal of Honor Airborne paratrooper parachute stuck in tree\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"EPIC LANDING OF PARATROOPERS ON THE NAZIS HEADS ! Medal of Honor Airborne - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0_HK2WeiWbM\"},{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor Airborne - FULL GAME walkthrough\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LVKiaRTdBSY\"},{\"title\":\"US Paratroopers in Epic Landing Operation - Normandy D-Day - Medal of Honor Airborne - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nqrkCvBF5jo\"},{\"title\":\"A parachuter was rescued after getting stuck in a tree - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/acqpPgVtpy4\"},{\"title\":\"Tree Landing - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CAvPEzvrbX8\"},{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor: Airborne. Full campaign\",\"url\":\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=utN1sFlvoWE&pp=ygUOI21pZGRsZW9maG9uZXI%3D\"},{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor: Airborne. Stuck on stairs, Died of suicide. - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fDIZB6ne4x8\"},{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor: Airborne - Greased Landing - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eqwiLOFxr5k\"},{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor Airborne - Full Game Walkthrough (Full HD 60 FPS) No Commentary - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=puJXIC-YnEM\"},{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor Airborne Gameplay Walkthrough ENDING - Der Flakturm - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3O4PNbBhk5M\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up anything specific about a paratrooper stuck in a tree in *Medal of Honor: Airborne*. The results are mostly gameplay videos about the game in general.\n\n- **The game:** One result describes it as a FPS video game released by Electronic Arts in 2007. Its protagonist is Boyd Travers, a U.S. paratrooper, per one walkthrough description (index 6-1).\n- **Tree-landing content:** The closest match is a short news clip titled \"A parachuter was rescued after getting stuck in a tree\" (index 4-1). It describes a real rescue, not the game, and the snippet doesn't give a date or location.\n- **Other related items:** A video called \"Tree Landing\" shows Canadian paratroopers being off-dropped into a pine tree during an exercise (index 5-3). It's a real-world exercise, not a game mission.\n\nI didn't find any source confirming a game mechanic or scripted event where a paratrooper gets stuck in a tree. If you're after that, a more specific search (such as a forum thread or wiki page on the game's physics or glitches) would likely help.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"049394d6-c23d-42fb-96f0-5dc0e6d6a2b8","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:27:25.948Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Medal of Honor Airborne paratrooper parachute stuck in tree","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_017obZrBQj6WmwQK8X2cboEE","content":[{"title":"EPIC LANDING OF PARATROOPERS ON THE NAZIS HEADS ! Medal of Honor Airborne - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0_HK2WeiWbM"},{"title":"Medal of Honor Airborne - FULL GAME walkthrough","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LVKiaRTdBSY"},{"title":"US Paratroopers in Epic Landing Operation - Normandy D-Day - Medal of Honor Airborne - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nqrkCvBF5jo"},{"title":"A parachuter was rescued after getting stuck in a tree - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/acqpPgVtpy4"},{"title":"Tree Landing - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CAvPEzvrbX8"},{"title":"Medal of Honor: Airborne. Full campaign","url":"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=utN1sFlvoWE&pp=ygUOI21pZGRsZW9maG9uZXI%3D"},{"title":"Medal of Honor: Airborne. Stuck on stairs, Died o