{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","id":"b05d7334-f5d2-48e0-918b-59d3b8e9b17e","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:28:39.130Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"b880ec811c15b646f9012e782c42974027e0eddc512cfae1370cf4df924f4f49","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"36204f19-66b2-4024-91ba-b73e98cc89ad","keep":681,"tail":["1b61a16f51022d25d180c18b2d9c0a161f8bec27061b715973e31f0fdedf5736","b4eec1e1735d55230fbfa0e0228dbcac855363c2ed51182415d784087f630aeb","656e8e740b7c42a00d924580f1289e7bd9ba5c3e99d56e79ca6e667ed02a004b"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",683,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"1a1026d1576a56945f309a36b7b1f90ad8a41d5235e9cc5bc8ab5ecfd6688e53"}
{"parentUuid":"1c59e6eb-4844-49ea-a359-2cdf70e28128","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGZnDd9WdCNSCzcAH4JK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Committed 06597f9f on `hedgerow-grass` (not pushed): three parachutes now hang caught in the trees along the forest track. I checked them headless only, on still frames and in `mv_chute.mp4` (sent above, 2.5 s at 60 fps), never in a real browser window.\n\n- **Why there:** the forest half of the route (track, trenches, bunker, camp) was the weakest at night, a flat, murky mass with nothing pale or lit between flares. Parachutes left in the trees since the airborne drop fit the Normandy setting, and the pale silk takes every flare, fire and lightning flash.\n- **What they look like:** each hangs on the side of the crown facing the track, snagged by its apex and two other points, falling in folds. A sheaf of pale lines runs below to where a man cut himself free. The silk shows its seams and is stained, torn and darkened by the rain. Where it hangs clear it sways in the gusts, and it casts shadows under a flare.\n- **How:** `chutes.js` picks three broadleaf trees 5–12 m off the track, 45 m apart, with crowns low enough to see. At load it simulates the canopy as cloth settling over each tree's crown.\n- **Tuning that mattered:** at first the silk lay on top of the crowns, out of sight from the ground, and then held a stiff dome; letting it crumple freely fixed both. The settling first cost about 1 s of load time; it's now about 0.13 s of the level's 3.2 s load. Drawing costs two calls and about 4,600 triangles.\n- **References:** no video frame I could find shows a canopy in a tree. A real tree-landing video shows a paratrooper hanging with his risers running straight up into the branches, which matches our sheaf of lines.\n- **Checks:** all three quality presets compile with no errors, including the flare's shadow passes. The nine node tests pass and the branch still merges cleanly with hedgerow-poc.\n\nThe test server and headless Chrome are stopped, the reference frames are deleted, and the shared notes have this turn's details.\n\nSources: [Tree Landing](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CAvPEzvrbX8), [Medal of Honor Airborne: Normandy landing](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nqrkCvBF5jo)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":323,"cache_read_input_tokens":611354,"output_tokens":770,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":323,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":770,"cache_read_input_tokens":611354,"cache_creation_input_tokens":323,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":323},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"bf23f396-366e-4e1a-9fc7-cba51d726699","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGZnD1grSqEPqycA4T6q","requestRef":"b05d7334-f5d2-48e0-918b-59d3b8e9b17e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"33a3e27c-55cf-4274-abd4-c002c5c16350","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:28:46.714Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
