{"parentUuid":"83486f10-979f-430f-baa5-c47219df0f74","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"17b7ed16-a101-4402-afdd-06026f97016b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016EpYH8EJGXxHVdcQ9bmJFz","type":"tool_result","content":"lamps and the glow of the sky, broken by rain rings the size of a\nraindrop's, many and quick (further off the rain only roughens the water),\na river of long low swells drawn out along the current with a finer chop\ncarried down it, banks soaked above the waterline with a thin broken line\nof scum where the water laps them and the water browner in the shallows of\nthe ford, a forest floor of last year's leaves with moss in the\ndamp, leaves and litter in the gutters, brick bits round the shelled houses,\nstones and fallen branches along the lane and the forest track, whose mud is\ncut by two wheel ruts with a grassy crown between them and water standing in\nthem in stretches, rainwater standing in the shell craters — rain in fine\nstreaks, falling in sheets far down the street, sweeping across in gusts,\ndripping and pouring in broken strings off the eaves, lit by lamps, fires\nand flares,\nhalos in the wet air, low mist, bullet holes that catch the light — stone\nchipped pale round a black hole, wood splintered, paint flaked off a dent to\nthe bare steel, a lit window's glass starred with cracks that catch the\nroom's light and shards of it falling, glinting — mud kicked up and the","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"31cee5f9-1f31-42cf-b23a-6e713e63c948","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:33:55.852Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"lamps and the glow of the sky, broken by rain rings the size of a\nraindrop's, many and quick (further off the rain only roughens the water),\na river of long low swells drawn out along the current with a finer chop\ncarried down it, banks soaked above the waterline with a thin broken line\nof scum where the water laps them and the water browner in the shallows of\nthe ford, a forest floor of last year's leaves with moss in the\ndamp, leaves and litter in the gutters, brick bits round the shelled houses,\nstones and fallen branches along the lane and the forest track, whose mud is\ncut by two wheel ruts with a grassy crown between them and water standing in\nthem in stretches, rainwater standing in the shell craters — rain in fine\nstreaks, falling in sheets far down the street, sweeping across in gusts,\ndripping and pouring in broken strings off the eaves, lit by lamps, fires\nand flares,\nhalos in the wet air, low mist, bullet holes that catch the light — stone\nchipped pale round a black hole, wood splintered, paint flaked off a dent to\nthe bare steel, a lit window's glass starred with cracks that catch the\nroom's light and shards of it falling, glinting — mud kicked up and the","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"045d337f-f0e4-4382-b257-bbfd61079e15","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","branch":"hedgerow-grass","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"83486f10-979f-430f-baa5-c47219df0f74","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io