{"parentUuid":"5ab28ce2-fd78-45dd-a82a-e00702370e41","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGaEYBqLzGj65YPzaUbH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011rZPd2HhuJ2w6f9FvteUSo","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, eleventh:\n- Survey of the far end (end_views.js: trench inside/front/approach, bunker, camp, tower): almost\n  black; only the bunker's slit (its 'lamp' anchor) and the tent's lamp. Model anchors worth\n  knowing: watchtower[light] (unused until now), bunker[lamp], tent[lamp], dugout_entrance[inside]\n  (not placed), jeep_wreck[smoke], sentry_box[guard]. Fires have no gameplay use (no damage, AI).\n- 3b3469d6 firelight in front of the trench line + the tower's lamp: levelBuild prop option\n  `burning: size` -> effects.addDebris + a static light (16*size, range 8+6*size, flicker 0.5,\n  FIRE_FOG); level: beam_charred (-14, 371) 0.7 and (19, 368.5) 0.55, log (7.5, 361) 0.6 (light\n  discipline: what the shelling set burning, not braziers); watchtower { light: true } (capped\n  lamp i9 r14 shadow + halo, the existing p.light path). The lamplight rain takes the fires.\n  Checks: low/medium/high compile (97/147/147, 0 bad), 9 node checks, merge-tree clean.\n  Clip mv_trench.mp4 sent. Not seen in a real browser window.\nEOF\nREDACTED; cd $S && node hl.mjs stop; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; lsof -nP -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; lsof -nP -iTCP:9337 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; pgrep -fl \"hl-profile|nocache_server\" | head; cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short | head; git log --oneline -1","description":"Note this turn, stop the rig and verify it is down","timeout":60000,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_deta