{"parentUuid":"cefca534-328c-454a-aa1a-5a09553a8d7c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGaGYeRaLr4XfbJG67Rx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Committed 3b3469d6 on `hedgerow-grass` (not pushed): fires left by the shelling now light the approach to the trench line, and the camp's watchtower lamp is on. I checked it headless only, on still frames and in `mv_trench.mp4` (sent above, 2.5 s at 60 fps), never in a real browser window.\n\n- **The problem:** the far end of the route (the approach to the trench, the trench itself, the camp) was almost black at night. The only light came from the bunker's firing slit and one tent.\n- **The fires:** a front line at night keeps light discipline, so the light comes from what the shelling set burning, not braziers. Two charred beams and a log burn before the wire, each with small flames, embers, a little smoke and its own flickering light. From the track they're pools of warm light in the dark wood, with rain glittering over them and the parachute between them.\n- **The tower lamp:** the camp's watchtower model always had a lamp position that the level never switched on. It's now lit, and its glow falls on the camouflage net and sandbags below.\n- **Two things to know:**\n  - New light near enemy positions makes soldiers there easier to see. That touches night readability, which has been your call so far, so say if you'd rather keep that end darker.\n  - The fires are close but not right beside the wire, so the wire itself picks up little of their light.\n- **Checks:** all three quality presets compile with no errors, the nine node tests pass, and the branch still merges cleanly with hedgerow-poc.\n\nThe test server and headless Chrome are stopped, and the shared notes have this turn's details."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":408,"cache_read_input_tokens":647631,"output_tokens":522,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":408,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":522,"cache_read_input_tokens":647631,"cache_creation_input_tokens":408,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":408},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4d4d5e80-15c8-4cf5-9604-e153e6488e6f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGaGXzjhKW11KDgtRJgb","requestRef":"8ad3f494-45a4-4500-bbd2-56fb8b203a00","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"4ba5caed-7a0d-419d-9aa1-175507cd78fe","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:35:08.917Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
